From cd066fea446624b281ccd9cdb11e14fc54392671 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: happy <happy@local>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:33:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] fix(ui): keep End Meeting off the main thread

Leave updates UI immediately and posts leaveConference without waiting for SDP. Join/PTT/mute coordinator reads run on Default so setRemoteDescription cannot ANR.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
